Copyright (c) 2026 CuonzTech · Carlo Cuonz. All rights reserved. Source-available,
proprietary, from version 0.2.1.

Versions 0.1.0 and 0.2.0 were published on npm under the MIT License and remain under MIT
for their recipients. Versions 0.2.1 to 0.3.3 were published under revision 2 of this license
(dated 2026-10-23); revision 2 remains authoritative for their recipients. This revision 3
applies to version 0.3.4 and later.

Without a license key you may install and run the software, including for commercial and
internal use. The scope depends on the target of the scan:
(a) Local targets (localhost, 127.0.0.1, ::1) are fully free for development, testing and
fixture purposes: full scan, detailed console gate, full JSON report and local auto-fix in
your own working directory.
(b) External targets (staging, production, any other address): determining the gate state
(PASS, BLOCKED, INCONCLUSIVE), the exit code and aggregate numbers (number of finding groups
and affected requests). The output is limited to these numbers; the generated report.json is
a slim result file marked limitedByLicense: true.

For external targets a valid license from CuonzTech is required for: detailed finding
reports (tracker names, URLs, evidence, phases, timelines), full reports in Markdown, HTML
and PDF as well as HAR exports, customer reports (--client), and auto-fix (creating and
applying patches in the working directory, commits and pull requests).
The number of domains per plan is based on trust and is not counted by the software.

You may not copy, sell, redistribute or sublicense the software, offer it as your own
product or service, or remove, bypass, disable or forge license checks, license keys or
license notices. Viewing the source code grants no right to modify or redistribute it.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is a technical aid, not
legal advice, and does not guarantee compliance with the Swiss revFADP, the GDPR or any
other law. Liability is excluded to the extent permitted by law.

Swiss law applies. Contact: support@cuonztech.ch
